      "type": "note",
      "text": "Dwight's memo says costumes need Acting RM approval; Dwight disqualified Andy's banjo and judged himself. Andy has his bear head, Dwight keeps Starbuck."
    },
    {
      "type": "note",
      "text": "Roy texted 'have fun babe' and forgot the costume contest. Jim is going as Dwight's stapler and looked at Pam's painter outfit."
    },
    {
      "type": "note",
      "text": "Creed won the costume contest for being Creed. Creed said 'I'm going to disappear now' and walked out."
    },
    {
      "type": "gag",
      "text": "Michael's Things I Love About Michael board: 61% from Dwight and an M&Ms note from Kevin; Darryl and Pam looked at it with Michael at the party."
    },
    {
      "type": "gag",
      "text": "Kevin: 'Nobody say nothing.' Used in the cold open, the bullpen fire bit and the tag."
    },
    {
